sut:ev-112ee79de4f2b85e a ev:Evidence ;
    ev:aboutObject sut:svc-otelcol ;
    ev:aboutPredicate ops:exportsTelemetryTo ;
    ev:aboutSubject sut:svc-shippingservice ;
    ev:acceptance "agreed" ;
    ev:basis "cited" ;
    ev:note "OTLP over gRPC: OTEL_COLLECTOR_HOST=otelcol (.env:27), OTEL_COLLECTOR_PORT_GRPC=4317 (.env:28); the collector's otlp receiver has a grpc protocol (src/otelcollector/otelcol-config.yml:6-7). Traces: src/shippingservice/src/telemetry/traces_conf.rs:16 opentelemetry_otlp::new_exporter().tonic() with install_batch(runtime::Tokio) at traces_conf.rs:18; no export interval or batch setting is set in these files (library default, not in these files). Metrics: Cargo.toml:22 enables only the opentelemetry 'trace' feature and no metrics pipeline is built in the given src files, so no metric export is stated. Logs: telemetry/logs_conf.rs:7 CombinedLogger of SimpleLogger only, no OTLP log exporter in code, so no log export to the collector is stated (logs go to the container stdout via the json-file driver, docker-compose.yml:573 'logging: *logging'). Harness override compose.candidate-postures.yml:126-130 sets OTEL_PLACEMENT_ENABLED, OTEL_SDK_DISABLED, OTEL_TRACES_EXPORTER, OTEL_METRICS_EXPORTER and OTEL_LOGS_EXPORTER from ${OTEL_CANDIDATE_SHIPPINGSERVICE_*}; whether the Rust SDK reads these is not stated in the given files." ;
    ev:quotedToken "OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT=http://${OTEL_COLLECTOR_HOST}:${OTEL_COLLECTOR_PORT_GRPC}" ;
    ev:sourceCommit "2d4661e4897aa7b2d2ddbb5ef8c4824ca8a1b88d" ;
    ev:sourceFile "docker-compose.yml" ;
    ev:sourceLine 567 ;
    ev:sourceRepo "upstream" .

